### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Gumawa ng transaction
POST http://localhost:5000/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "item_id": 1, "type": "SELL", "qty": 7 }

### Maglogin admin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "UmizoomieJBTec@ims.com", "password": "Umizoomie@25" }

### Kunin lahat ng items
GET http://localhost:5000/api/items

### Kunin isang item
GET http://localhost:5000/api/items/1

### I-edit ang item
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bolt M8 Stainless"
}

### Hanapin gamit ang SKU
GET http://localhost:5000/api/items/sku/BLT-adfe

### Burahin ang item
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/items/1

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. LOGIN bilang admin (pangalanan natin: loginAdmin)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "UmizoomieJBTec@ims.com",
  "password": "Umizoomie@25"
}

### 2. Sino ako? (gamit ang admin token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 3. Gumawa ng staff user (admin lang)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": "Juan Staff",
  "email": "juan@ims.com",
  "password": "Staff12345",
  "role": "staff"
}

### 4. LOGIN bilang staff (pangalanan natin: loginStaff)
# @name loginStaff
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan@ims.com",
  "password": "Staff12345"
}

### 5. GET items WALANG token (dapat 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items

### 6. GET items may admin token (dapat 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 7. GET items may staff token (dapat 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaff.response.body.token}}

### 8. Staff DELETE (dapat 403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/items/2
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaff.response.body.token}}

### 9. Staff REGISTER (dapat 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaff.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": "Test",
  "email": "test@ims.com",
  "password": "Test12345"
}

### 10. Staff stock IN/OUT (dapat 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaff.response.body.token}}

{
  "item_id": 2,
  "type": "OUT",
  "qty": 1
}

### 11. Maling password (dapat 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "UmizoomieJBTec@ims.com",
  "password": "mali"
}